      "cat-harness:section": "/one-voice-integration-watcher",
      "prov:value": "**Persistent operation (binding).** Per the repo owner's standing\npreference, this watcher **never stops** in foreground sessions.\nWhen no main commits or PR events arrive in a TICK window, the\nwatcher pulls the next staleness-backlog block (§5 inherited\nfrom the parent, §5d auto-pull policy). The QA reports it writes\nduring these idle windows ARE the knowledge base that informs\nfuture content reviews — the staleness map of which criteria are\nfresh, stale, or never-audited per block.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner"
      ]
    }
  ]
